 "stimulus_html": "<p>Use the following scenario to answer questions 1 – 5.</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>Based on past musical productions, a theater predicts selling <span data-math=\"400-8p\">400-8p</span> tickets when each ticket is sold at <span data-math=\"p\">p</span> dollars.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\">\n  <li>Answer questions a–g to complete the middle column in the table to find out how many tickets the theater expects to sell and what revenues it expects to receive at the given ticket prices.</li>\n</ol>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Ticket price (dollars)</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Number of tickets sold</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Revenue (dollars)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span data-math=\"5\">5</span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span data-math=\"360\">360</span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span data-math=\"1800\">1800</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span data-math=\"10\">10</span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>a. _____</p>\n</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span data-math=\"15\">15</span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>b. _____</p>\n</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span data-math=\"20\">20</span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>c. _____</p>\n</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span data-math=\"30\">30</span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>d. _____</p>\n</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span data-math=\"45\">45</span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>e. _____</p>\n</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span data-math=\"50\">50</span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>f. _____</p>\n</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span data-math=\"p\">p</span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>g. _____</p>\n</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
